---
import WhatsappLink from './WhatsappLink.astro';
import { business } from '../data/business';
---
<section id="df-contact" class="section contact container"><div class="contact-panel"><div><span class="eyebrow">Estamos para acompañarte</span><h2>Tu próxima visita<br />empieza con un mensaje.</h2><p>Escribinos para consultar y coordinar un turno para vos o tu familia con nuestro equipo.</p></div><div class="contact-action"><WhatsappLink variant="light">Solicitar turno por WhatsApp</WhatsappLink><a class="phone" href={`tel:+${business.phone}`}>{business.phoneLabel}</a><p>WhatsApp se abre en otra pestaña.<br />El turno se coordina por conversación.</p></div></div></section>
<style>
.contact-panel{background:var(--navy);color:#f4f0e9;padding:52px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center;box-shadow:0 12px 30px #1b2b4a12;}
.contact-panel .eyebrow{color:var(--yellow);}
h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,52px);margin-bottom:22px;}
.contact-panel>div>p{max-width:480px;}
.contact-action{text-align:right;}
.phone{display:block;font-size:23px;font-family:var(--serif);color:var(--yellow);padding-top:14px;min-height:44px;}
.contact-action p{font-size:14px;margin-top:8px;}
.contact-action :global(.df-button){font:400 21px/1.3 var(--serif);padding:15px 26px;}
@media(max-width:1023px){.contact-panel{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:40px;}.contact-action{text-align:left;}}
@media(max-width:767px){.contact-panel{padding:30px 24px;gap:28px;}.contact-action :global(.df-button){font-size:19px;}}
</style>
